mode: "100644"
text: "# Metrics by goal, the report + two worked examples\n\n## Metric-by-goal matrix\n| Goal | Primary KPI | Supporting | Read it for |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Awareness | Reach / follower-growth-rate | impressions, new-vs-returning | did distribution expand |\n| Engagement | ER by reach | saves, shares, comments | did content resonate + spread |\n| Video | Avg watch time / completion | retention curve, drop-off (25% increments) | hook + holding power |\n| Traffic | CTR / link clicks | UTM sessions, engaged sessions | did it move people off-platform |\n| Conversion | CVR / sign-ups / sales | CPA, social-attributed conv. (GA4) | did it produce outcomes |\n| Loyalty | Repeat engagement / response time | sentiment, UGC volume | community health |\n\n## Platform signal cheat-sheet (optimise the right one)\nIG → **saves** · TikTok → **shares** · LinkedIn → **dwell time + saves** · YouTube → **watch time/\nretention** · Pinterest → **outbound clicks/saves** · X → **replies/bookmarks** · Facebook → **saves/\nshares**. (Pull each from that platform's native dashboard.)\n\n## The monthly report template (~30 min compile / 10 present)\n```\n1. OUTCOMES (lead here): goal KPIs vs target + vs last period (traffic, leads, sales, growth-rate)\n2. WHY: the content-performance metrics that explain the outcomes (top posts, formats, retention)\n3. BY PLATFORM: the one signal metric per active platform + trend\n4. WHAT WE LEARNED: 2-3 honest findings (incl. what underperformed)\n5. RECOMMENDATIONS: exactly 3 specific next actions (scale / cut / test)\n```\nLead with outcomes, not vanity. Every figure cites its **native source**. No gaps filled by guesses.\n\n## Worked example 1 — weekly Reel-retention read (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nPULL (IG Insights): Reel A 62% avg watch, 140 saves/10k reach. Reel B 28% avg watch, drop-off at 0:03.\nREAD: B loses people at the hook (first 3s). A's \"30% rule\" topic + fast open held + got saved.\nDO NEXT: more \"one-rule\" hooks; re-cut B's opening; test a text-hook vs talking-head (-> experimentation).\nLOOP: A is a recycle candidate (-> content-recycling).\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — monthly outcomes-first snapshot (warm studio voice)\n```\nOUTCOMES: newsletter sign-ups from social +18% MoM (UTM/GA4); follower-growth-rate 2.1% (steady).\nWHY: carousels on \"first-time freelancer tax\" drove the saves + profile visits that fed sign-ups.\nPLATFORM SIGNAL: IG saves up, TikTok shares flat, LinkedIn dwell up.\nLEARNED: long captions underperformed on TikTok (honest note).\nRECOMMENDATIONS: 1) double the beginner-tax carousel cadence 2) shorten TikTok captions + test 3) move the link to the first comment on FB.\n```\n\nBoth: goal-mapped; native numbers only (no fabrication); signal over vanity; relative read; ends in\n**specific next actions** that feed `content-recycling` / `experimentation-and-ab-testing` / `social-strategy`.\n"
